  "name": "Example: \n                    Finding the Absolute Value of a Positive Number",
  "problem": "What is the value of $\\mid 4\\!\\mid \\,?$",
  "worked_solution": "The absolute value of a positive number equals the number:\n\n$$\n\\eqalign{\n\t\\mid 4\\!\\mid \\, =4\t\n\t}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of a number gives the distance between the number and zero on a number line.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14145654/assets/4dc8f8174b1a226b3cfeaedc9e909adce1171c9daca1833d80ca09b286115755.png)",
